Subject: [PATCH 6/7] region hooks test: her r4-prep B+ board copy at the board
 camera (= hook end pose), per screen

girl-frame.cjs projects characterBox(landing spot, 1.7253 m, 0.3 m) through the meadow / skycity board
camera on 5 screens against boardLayout(boardSafeInsets): where visible she must be <= 80% of frame width,
inside REGION_CAMERA.frameLimits and not under the tray / goal plate; tool-icon overlap is reported.
Finding (reported, no camera change): meadow - visible, 4-6% wide, but under the 3rd tool icon when 3 tools
show (portrait); skycity - never in frame (camera ends 2-12 m beside her, looking at the star court).
